---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="rocket-launch" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Technical Design</h2>
		<p>End-to-end solution design across frontend, backend, payments, CMS integrations, technical readiness, and delivery flow.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Journey mapping</li>
			<li>Integration decisions</li>
			<li>Delivery readiness</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Architecture & Quality</h2>
		<p>Hands-on architecture alignment, code quality, maintainability, vulnerability management, and technical risk support for complex journeys.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Angular and TypeScript</li>
			<li>Governance</li>
			<li>Maintainability</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Payments & Support</h2>
		<p>Booking and payment journey ownership, including secure payment flows, orchestration, 3DS, tokenisation, authorization, Splunk, logs, and issue investigation.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>3DS and tokenisation</li>
			<li>Production triage</li>
			<li>Operational handover</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gray-999) 82%, transparent);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
	}

	.skills ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin-top: auto;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.skills li {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 999rem;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
		color: var(--gray-300);
		font-size: var(--text-xs);
		line-height: 1;
		background: var(--gray-999_40);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}

		.skills > div {
			border-left: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
		}

		.skills > div:first-child {
			border-left: 0;
			padding-left: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
